  "note": "Each case replaces one field of the base offer and classifies the result against the base, as failover does. A valid change to the Reward Policy or payout requirements is a material change that needs fresh Work Consent. An offer must pay a network-valid result directly in the coinbase, allocate exactly 10,000 basis points, create no revenue claim or custodial balance, require a payout choice, keep that choice ephemeral by default, and accept only a mainnet address or an approved beneficiary. rejected_shape means the offer doesn't parse.",
